---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site, has, emailHref } from '@/config/site';
const mail = emailHref('Privacy request');
---

<LegalLayout page="privacy" heading="Privacy Policy" draft>
  <p>
    This policy explains how {site.name} ("we", "us") handles personal data collected through this
    website, in line with the basic requirements of India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act,
    2023.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <p>Only what you enter in our forms (distributor enquiry, contact and adverse-event forms):</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name, company or firm name, business type</li>
    <li>State, district or city</li>
    <li>Phone number, WhatsApp number (optional) and email address</li>
    <li>Products of interest and the message you write</li>
    <li>For adverse-event reports: product name, batch number and description</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We use privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
  <p>
    To respond to your enquiry, to follow up on distributor or business discussions, and to
    investigate product feedback or adverse-event reports. We do not use your data for anything
    unrelated.
  </p>

  <h2>Consent</h2>
  <p>
    We collect and use your data only with your consent, given by ticking the consent box on our
    forms. You can withdraw consent at any time by contacting us; withdrawal does not affect earlier
    lawful processing.
  </p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>
    We keep enquiry records only as long as needed for the purpose above and for any legal
    requirement, and then delete them. Adverse-event records may be kept for longer where required
    by regulation. <strong>[Retention periods to be confirmed by the company.]</strong>
  </p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell your data. We use service providers (processors) only to operate the website: web
    hosting and security (Cloudflare) and email delivery (Resend). They process data on our
    instructions.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Access a summary of the personal data we hold about you</li>
    <li>Ask us to correct or erase your data</li>
    <li>Withdraw consent</li>
    <li>
      Seek grievance redressal, and, if unresolved, complain to the Data Protection Board of India
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Grievances and data requests</h2>
  <p>
    Write to us{' '}
    {mail ? (
      <>
        at <a href={mail}>{site.email}</a>
      </>
    ) : (
      'using the contact page'
    )}
    {has(site.address.line1) && <>, or at our registered address.</>}. We will respond within a
    reasonable time.
  </p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served over HTTPS, forms are protected against abuse, and access to stored
    submissions is restricted.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy and will post the latest version on this page.</p>
</LegalLayout>
